--- !u!114 &114394459890091462
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1978153537373109}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 1266
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 哼，油嘴滑舌。虽不知你是怎么快达到元婴境界，但多半是你自恃实力出言不逊，才引老朽徒儿怒而出手。
