  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 1297
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 不过他冲虚散人好不容易到了元婴前期，却败在你一个晚辈手里，换做是其他人怕也是难以接受。更不用说你还曾为林家出头，坏了他的奸计，对你早已是怀恨在心。两者相合之下，对他的打击之大更是不言而喻。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 0
  AvatarID: {fileID: 0}
  AvatarIntID: 0
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114565104211904330
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1978153537373109}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 1236
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 好了，无惑师徒确实做的不对，小友你也不用再奚落他二人。还是让冲虚自己来说说突破的事吧。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114523241426649246}
  AvatarIntID: 2243
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
